.<br></li><li>At 100% launch a Solo that will power up your Instrument!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/81fda3ce64077f642ecb303fa8c16009.poster.avif?t=1760986413\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/81fda3ce64077f642ecb303fa8c16009.webm?t=1760986413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/81fda3ce64077f642ecb303fa8c16009.mp4?t=1760986413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>UPGRADES:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>At the end of the Round choose from a selection of Upgrades!<br></li><li>Slowly building up a stack of ability that mow through hordes of Enemies. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/825110348d656f1a1dad4399184f41b1.poster.avif?t=1760986413\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/825110348d656f1a1dad4399184f41b1.webm?t=1760986413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093050/extras/825110348d656f1a1dad4399184f41b1.mp4?t=1760986413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br><strong>STORY:</strong> <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Roxie's music venue is burned down, her friend's are dead and their spirits are under Death's control. <br></li><li>After defeating Boss Fights at the end of your run, re-live Roxie’s memories and piece together her tragic story. </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets